@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health probe
GET {{host}}/health

### A2A AgentCard
GET {{host}}/.well-known/agent-card.json

### Query invoices through A2A JSON-RPC
POST {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "1",
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "message/send",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "kind": "message",
      "role": "user",
      "messageId": "msg-1",
      "parts": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Show me all invoices for Contoso"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}